window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>\"Who was I? How did I come here? Why did I feel so much pain?\"</p> <p>Waking up barefoot in the woods with no memory of who he is or how he got there, a young man known only by the name \"Stranger\" sets off on a journey through the bizarre reality of World City—a place seemingly outside of time and space where the people speak in riddles, and the game is played by an entirely different set of rules.</p> <p>With each new character he meets, Stranger’s path takes him through the streets, the nightclubs, the churches, the prisons, the courts, and finally to the highest power in the world, where he must make a choice that will forever alter the fate of the city.</p> <p>Confronting the world’s biggest problems while searching for the answers to his life’s deepest questions, this stranger in a strange land must find something that is true in this lost city and have faith if he ever wants to find his way back home.</p>"; 
